.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.zcode/
.windsurf/
.trae/
.roo/
.aider*
continue/
.aws/
.ssh/


# ── 内部文档与开发状态：不入版本控制，避免泄漏 ──
# README.md / CHANGELOG.md / SKILL.md / references/ / evals/ 是仓库正式内容，保持跟踪
drafts/
notes/
private/
internal/
dev/
dev-notes/
.archive/
.research/
*.draft.md
*.local.md
*.wip.md
DEVLOG.md
